{
  "menu": "Shared art",
  "order": 4,
  "note": "Assets drawn by many menus (Phase 7). The scrollbar: the Dark scrollbar instances MIC_UI_Scrollbar_Vert_Dark and MIC_UI_ScrollbarVert_Handle_Dark hold no colours, so the [Skin] scrollbar values are baked into their parent materials' defaults (CachedExpressionData and the shader map's uniform defaults; KB docs/reverse-engineering/dark-mode-ui.md 'Scrollbar materials', game 1.512.105.0). Every scrollbar but Settings (Light instances) takes them. RMI-087 (owner 2026-11-12, baked not run time): the shared button prefab's label, rules and hover band (Confirm/Cancel and every other WBP_ModernPrefab_Button). RMI-096 (owner 2026-11-13, all popups): the popup paper textures (M_Popup_PaperBackground has no colour parameters) on parchment, and every popup text literal light (rowText; the blue ones enchantedDot). RMI-096 styling (owner 2026-11-13): popup paper paper_scale:0.42 (the shader lifts it ~44), the Laurels group (pattern: Inventory button laurels, popup title flowers, leaf border) blue, sliders silver, focus band highlight grey. RMI-096 paper swap (owner 2026-11-13): import_swaps point the 11 popups' paper at T_UI_BackgroundHorizontal (Dark Mode UI's route; the shader material is bypassed), baked by popup_paper.",
